name  Features
theme dungeon
spawn 2.5 2.5 0
entity c crystal
# C-map demo: the three world features that used to be runtime-only.
#   mask  — a see-through grate in the west wall (walk up to x=1,y=5)
#   anim  — a flickering wall panel cycling textures 1-2-3-4 at 6fps
#   mover — a lift "gate" on the floor; call it from the console: mover gate up
mask 1 5 0.5
anim 6 2 6 1 2 3 4
mover gate 0 0.6 0.3 down 4 6 5 6
surface metal 4 6 5 6
surface water 2 2 3 2
